  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Res. &amp; Cons. of thorn scrub and deciduos forest in Sierra Tamaulipas II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will protect 7,413 acres of forest through conservation agreements and begin the restoration of 494 acres of denuded habitat by preventing erosion and increasing moisture content. Partners will also establish fire prevention measures in 11,119 acres of forest.</narrative>
